  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;ABC</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the lengths of sides <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;respectively. If the area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>ABC</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> are respectively the radii of circumcircle and incircle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;ABC</mi></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mtext>in&#160;cm</mtext><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to ______ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>sinA</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sinA</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5eca92cc-c7b7-4839-9ca6-b2523966f307-image.png\" style=\"width: 214px; height: 162px;\" /></p>",
